' The inventory from the world map (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start
' 30 party`: a companion handed over, a prepared state). v1.2's
' `MapScene.OnMenuInventory` (MapScene.cs:1141-1150) opens `InventoryScene`
' on `SelectedCharacter ?? Character` with no room and no pile: `hint2`,
' music `room`, the group's pages, nothing on the right
' (InventoryScene.cs:390-483). A right click eats or drinks for the group
' as anywhere; a left click on an item does nothing (nowhere to put it).
' Reached by the menu line INVENTORY and the Inventory action (E, I).
' Before: "the inventory is not in this port yet". (The group is first
' walked into Paradise Camp and out, so that both stand together as v1.2's
' range filter wants them.)
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
esc                      ' the world map
wait 10
day                      ' a day on: hungry
wait 30
menu 300,200             ' the map's menu
menuline 1               ' INVENTORY
wait 5
snap map_inventory
press right              ' the first item lit: the meat
press space              ' Primary, its left click: nothing
wait 2
press f                  ' Secondary, its right click: the group eats
wait 2
snap map_inventory_eaten
esc                      ' back to the map
wait 5
press e                  ' the Inventory key
wait 5
snap map_inventory_key
press escape
wait 5
quit
